Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.11,0:00:06.57,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,New worlds are being born on a daily basis,\N like bubbles rising to the surface.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.57,0:00:11.00,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,This has been corroborated by the observation of a growing number of worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.33,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,The existence of the "observer" at the root of them all
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.33,0:00:16.83,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,has long since been predicted by scholars.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.83,0:00:19.75,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,This observer has at last been discovered.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.75,0:00:24.76,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,All of our drifting has been brought about by this boy, named Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.09,0:00:24.76,Overlap,Victims Society,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's the guy?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.76,0:00:27.97,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,Owing to his actions,\N our futures have been stolen from us,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.97,0:00:31.14,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,and we have been subjected to the absurdity of different worlds!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.14,Overlap,Victims Society,0,0,0,,{\an8}Where is this guy?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.47,0:00:33.68,Default,Victims Society,0,0,0,,{\an8}Burn him at the stake!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.23,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,He has manifested a great tragedy.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.73,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,Nagara is guilty of a serious crime.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.73,0:00:41.36,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,And now, in accordance with our rules,\N we shall condemn him.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.36,0:00:44.82,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,The coming tragedy must be prevented.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.82,0:00:48.45,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what manner of judgment they pass.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.45,0:00:51.45,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,We will dispatch Koumori the Convictor, of the Beatnik.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.83,0:00:55.21,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,We know that he will exact a just sentence.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.34,0:01:01.21,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.05,0:01:04.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Could you go on ahead without me?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.47,0:01:06.93,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Oh? Did you forget something?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.93,0:01:10.10,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,No, there's just... something I need to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.35,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.93,0:01:16.35,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we gonna do? Stick with Hoshi?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.77,0:01:18.40,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.32,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to go. We're finished.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.36,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,We've graduated.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.70,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,We have to decide for ourselves what to do now.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.08,0:01:36.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Wow, so you can travel to other worlds in that?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.16,0:01:40.38,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Don't bother asking to come with us,\N because you're not invited.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.38,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Well, that's a shame.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.38,0:01:46.51,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,While I'm thinking of it,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.51,0:01:50.68,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,there are other castaways who travel between worlds, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.68,0:01:54.68,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Yeah. Like you guys, they use power relics
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.02,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,or take advantage of the properties of a world.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.31,0:02:00.48,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Really? Sounds easier than I expected.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.48,0:02:06.23,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,It might sound easy now,\N but the ability to travel to other worlds
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.23,0:02:10.28,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,took many thousands of years to develop.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.57,0:02:14.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Ew, I can't believe it took thousands of years.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.29,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Immortality sure sounds boring.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.79,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,What kind of people are the other castaways?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.12,0:02:22.88,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What if they were all like Ms. Aki?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.13,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,I really wish that phony teacher would give up the act already.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.13,0:02:29.67,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,She really had us going.\N Who'd have thought she's our age in here?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.67,0:02:32.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,She must have gone to our school once, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.89,0:02:35.18,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,It's true, there are all sorts of people.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.02,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,But you all possess something immensely powerful.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.64,0:02:42.81,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,That ship should keep you all safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.48,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Whatcha reading there?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.99,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's this? "Robinson Crusoe"?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.99,0:02:51.45,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,G-Give it back!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.45,0:02:52.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,How do you have the time?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:52.53,0:02:56.16,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You should stop reading that and go help Rajdhani.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.16,0:02:56.62,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.50,0:03:01.33,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it. Just like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.83,Alt Styling,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What are you up to over here—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.46,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the shortest route to take.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.46,0:03:06.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What are you doing with this?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.80,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Observing it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.80,0:03:11.55,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's quite entertaining how they're always going between the same places.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.55,0:03:14.97,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if it's up or down—\Nthey do as they please.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.97,0:03:17.39,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,In the end, what do you think they always do?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.14,0:03:23.35,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,They start eating each other. Until there's only one left.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.10,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Watching them makes me wonder...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.11,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,might we also end up—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.36,0:03:28.61,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.61,0:03:29.36,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Setting them free!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.11,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You can't! I'm still watching them!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.62,0:03:39.04,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.04,0:03:42.00,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, something crazy's happening on your screen.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.04,0:03:46.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Let's leave him to himself.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.68,0:04:07.19,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,{\i1}This drifting was caused by your power, Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.73,0:04:11.98,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,But you don't need to feel responsible for it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.45,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,God gave you this power knowing full well what it would do.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.16,0:04:19.20,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,You were being used before you even knew what was happening.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.33,Default,Yamabiko,0,0,0,,Nothing more.{This episode brought to you by: this phrase. - Lann}
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,A bat?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What's an exercise bar doing out here?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.48,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Wake up. Wake up, already!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.62,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You gotta wake up. Otherwise...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.91,0:05:02.74,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.58,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.70,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your number?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.12,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.38,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,I asked you what your number is!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Um, 3-B, 25.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.84,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Group 3-B!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.55,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Fall in, right now!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.64,0:05:25.22,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,I've noted significant issues with Number 25's productivity!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.64,0:05:29.02,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Your group will answer for this by having another 50 kilos
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.40,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,added to today's quota of 800!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.32,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Any problems, take them up with Number 25!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.32,0:05:33.86,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.73,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Get back to work!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.69,0:05:38.57,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.61,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Look, it's simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.95,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You take the blocks you get from the top and carry them down.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.95,0:05:44.87,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.38,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.38,0:05:56.21,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,Hey! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,R-Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's about time I head back.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.22,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.22,0:06:08.27,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,They finally found the guy\N responsible for setting us adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.23,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,They say his name is Nagara,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.23,0:06:15.19,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,and the Beatnik have determined it's because of him that the drifting is happening.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.19,0:06:21.03,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,Our lives would have been so much better if it weren't for that guy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.03,0:06:21.78,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.57,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.57,0:06:25.62,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.62,0:06:29.00,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I'm Futatsuboshi. What's your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.00,0:06:31.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,N-Naga... ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.29,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Nagata, that was a close one today.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, sorry. Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.63,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Nah, I wasn't looking for gratitude.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.55,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You just reminded me of when I was a new guy,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.55,0:06:47.56,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,and before I knew it I was waking you up. Yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.56,0:06:49.10,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you guys students from Shiraito Middle School No. 2 too?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.81,0:06:56.61,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You really don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.57,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Bet you're a novice castaway, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.57,0:07:00.28,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Novice?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.28,0:07:04.11,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're all students from Shiraito Middle School No. 2.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.11,0:07:08.03,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's been an awful long time since we were middle-schoolers, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.24,0:07:13.25,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Right now, we're all building that tower together. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.12,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What's it for?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.75,0:07:16.25,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,We're trying to get to Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.54,0:07:17.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Heaven?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.63,0:07:20.96,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Heaven is the way out, back to our own world.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.38,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The way out? To the outside?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.38,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Of course. But it's more than just that.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.38,0:07:29.26,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,We're hunting for treasure while we're at it. Yeah, nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.10,0:07:32.47,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So Heaven is the way out,\N but there's also treasure?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What is the objective here, exactly?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.89,0:07:37.65,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Well, both of them. Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.69,0:07:45.03,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Okay, we're here.\N This is our three-star hotel.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.32,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.07,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.70,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Nothing. Good night.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.70,0:07:50.91,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.80,0:08:03.76,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.38,0:08:07.93,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,Your power won't work here.{I feel like there's potential for a meme here but perhaps it is too forced. We already used it in ep 1 in any case. I'm just noting it to make it known that I have spotted this opportunity to insert a meme and that I am too hesitant to do anything about it -Moe}
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.93,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,Because that's the way I decided it would be.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.95,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been wondering...\N Why are we carrying the blocks down?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.95,0:08:27.53,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.03,0:08:30.87,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I mean, we're building a tower, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.87,0:08:33.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It'd make more sense if we were carrying them up.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.49,0:08:36.45,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Huh, that's just the way it is, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.96,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Maybe they're building the foundations or something.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.96,0:08:42.04,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,"Or something"? You don't know?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.09,0:08:45.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Okay, then when will the tower be finished?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.59,0:08:48.72,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,There you go, talking funny again.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.72,0:08:53.64,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's been 200 years since I got here,\N and I've never even considered that.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? You've been at this for 200 years?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.69,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be surprised at just 200 years.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.69,0:09:00.69,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,There's veterans who've been at it for over a thousand.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.57,0:09:06.44,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.44,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.45,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,That's Susugashira.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.45,0:09:14.45,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,He's a bigshot host, who's also part of the Beatnik.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.20,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Host? Beatnik?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.79,0:09:20.21,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,A host is sort of like the boss of their world.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.71,0:09:24.04,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,And the Beatnik are whatcha might call a dream team,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.04,0:09:27.63,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,made up of all the elites from different worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.59,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,They travel to different worlds and take an active part in them.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.59,0:09:34.05,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,These elites are currently investigating the cause of the drifting.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.85,0:09:39.77,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Who was that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Me...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.19,0:09:43.65,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I've never seen one of these fall down before.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.65,0:09:46.44,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Other than one of mine, I mean. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.44,0:09:47.48,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.07,0:09:53.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.91,0:09:55.83,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Congrats on your starting pay!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Starting pay? This?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.79,0:10:02.29,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Okay, Nagata, it's my treat tonight!\N Let's go all out! Nothing more!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.33,0:10:09.42,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I hope they pulverize this guy. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.55,0:10:16.43,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I hate this guy more than anybody. Setting us all adrift like this...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.43,0:10:18.39,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,How could he do such a terrible thing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.89,0:10:20.47,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Listen, Futatsuboshi...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.06,0:10:21.56,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.98,0:10:25.56,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,What would you do if I was this Nagara guy?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.36,0:10:31.32,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,There's no way you're anybody that awful.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.99,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I mean, Nagata, you and me are kindred spirits.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.20,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Are you new here?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.45,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's under me. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.08,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.33,0:10:48.84,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Hey, new guy, have you ever heard the legend of the shooting star?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? No...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.38,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Word is that somewhere in this tower,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.55,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,there's a room that shooting stars fall into.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.39,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Isn't that romantic?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.35,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, romantic!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.89,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,If I catch a shooting star, I'm going to make a wish
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.89,0:11:08.48,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,that I'll meet a handsome husband in Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.40,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.99,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Aww, I'm sure you'll meet someone.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.65,0:11:19.20,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,Nagara has settled in nicely to this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.20,0:11:21.74,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,And he doesn't seem to have found the truth behind Babel.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.62,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.88,0:11:33.09,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Can'tcha sleep, Nagata?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.88,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.88,0:11:38.26,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Then you wanna go searching for shooting stars with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.64,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted. Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.14,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,You're exhausted? After just that?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm at my limit.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.19,0:11:58.82,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're chasing some\N urban legend that might not even be real.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.74,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's okay if we don't find anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.74,0:12:03.28,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.87,0:12:08.21,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,The important thing is that we went looking, nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.21,0:12:10.50,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I'll betcha Hime is gonna be tickled to hear.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.00,0:12:14.46,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's why you dragged me all the way out here?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.13,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's important.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.13,0:12:19.51,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,How deeply you believe in nonsense is important.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.34,0:12:24.76,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Because if we don't,\N we won't have anything. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.14,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Good to go?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.90,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm going back.\N We have an early start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.02,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.90,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's the same as building the tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.36,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,There aren't any castaways who really believe
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.91,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,that we'll reach Heaven someday.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.28,0:12:46.37,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Whatcha looking at me like that for?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.37,0:12:48.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.50,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.79,0:12:55.42,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Then why are we all doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.76,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I'm just a simple worker ant.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.76,0:13:03.47,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,I'm happier giving in to hope like this, even if it's false.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.35,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.35,0:13:06.68,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm not like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I didn't...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.43,0:13:12.31,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Nah, it's okay. Here, you can have this.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.31,0:13:13.69,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,It'll cheer you up.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.69,0:13:15.06,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Where did you...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.73,0:13:19.99,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,If you don't want it, I'll—
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.99,0:13:20.57,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.41,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Found it! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ah, it's so good!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.17,0:13:35.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Wait, no it isn't. It's just...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.55,0:13:42.22,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Whoa! Shooting stars!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.76,0:13:44.72,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.93,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Th-They're really here!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.18,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.69,0:13:53.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.94,0:13:54.69,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.82,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,These are bugs that emit light in the darkness of the caves.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.86,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Why do you think they do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't know, why?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.03,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,They lure other bugs in with these pretty lights,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.32,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,then hook them with their suspended slime.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.32,0:14:08.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.33,0:14:10.83,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, get out of there!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.04,Default,Futatsuboshi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagara!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.72,0:14:30.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.26,0:14:34.23,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and come on out!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.23,0:14:37.10,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,How far did he go to set those ants free?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Oh, there! Over there!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.52,0:14:41.23,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, Rajdhani!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.23,0:14:43.15,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This ant is...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.15,0:14:46.49,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm telling you, Nagara is somewhere close by!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.50,Default,Worker Ants,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.63,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Oh, hey new guy!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.05,0:15:03.71,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,All by yourself today?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.55,0:15:06.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, this is for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.76,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It looks so good!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.22,0:15:16.77,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What is this?! It tastes awful!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.65,0:15:25.03,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.78,0:15:29.03,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,What are you so displeased with?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.54,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,It's a wondrous sight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.04,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,Babel, rising ever upward into Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.75,0:15:43.34,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,A vacuous emptiness, built by human hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But then I learned.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.55,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Did you find Nagara?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.55,0:15:52.60,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.60,0:15:55.18,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Apparently Mizuho and Yamabiko went to pick him up.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.85,0:15:58.14,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't need to help them?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.19,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be of any use there.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.44,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.86,0:16:06.73,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Nagara has the power to change worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.73,0:16:09.45,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Besides, he's fine on his own now.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.78,0:16:12.28,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is that something God told you?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.78,0:16:14.70,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I don't hear that voice anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.33,0:16:17.54,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I should have done this way sooner.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.16,0:16:20.71,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Then I could have heard you a lot more clearly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.08,0:16:23.08,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It's a bit late for that.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.63,0:16:27.71,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.31,0:16:40.81,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,At last, the time for us to depart has come.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.81,0:16:43.35,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,This will be a journey to find our new home.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.36,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Fear not—we have our freedom!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.98,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,And more importantly, we have our friendship.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.98,0:16:50.36,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.95,0:17:00.62,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.21,0:17:05.58,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Aren't the others worried about Nagara?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.71,0:17:07.88,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.64,0:17:20.93,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,See that boy? He couldn't even do a back hip circle.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.93,0:17:24.60,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,But after lots of practice,\N he's gotten so good he can do {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Everyone calls that boy Koumori the Bat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.74,0:17:34.40,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't want to be like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.40,0:17:36.66,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,There's no point in being able to do this.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.62,0:17:39.62,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.24,0:17:43.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Turning this world upside down.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.16,0:17:47.42,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I have to keep moving forward to make up for everyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.67,0:17:54.72,Default,Susugashira,0,0,0,,So you knew?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.47,0:17:57.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Give Futatsuboshi my regards.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.85,0:18:11.23,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagara. You're at the top.\N I'm impressed you made it here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.15,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,I wonder if you remember me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.03,0:18:19.87,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.08,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Koumori the Bat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.17,0:18:32.30,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,This world is a great big pit, turned upside down.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.30,0:18:35.38,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,To keep everyone safe, I lock hope up in there.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.13,0:18:38.38,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Using my Upside-Down power, that is.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.01,0:18:41.68,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.22,0:18:46.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Even so, I've decided I won't run away anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.73,0:18:49.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Because I don't want our going adrift to be a mistake.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.15,0:18:51.86,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,You've changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.61,0:18:57.28,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.53,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you're all right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.87,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,You're free.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.04,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,Why did you let Nagara off?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.54,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,We must not descend into madness.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.42,0:19:16.30,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Besides, Nagara is a castaway, just like ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.72,Default,Victims Society,0,0,0,,Why didn't you pass judgment?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.72,0:19:19.59,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,Will this put a stop to all the tragedies?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.59,0:19:22.14,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,There won't be any more needless tragedies.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.68,Default,Victims Society Speaker,0,0,0,,Will that be enough to convince the others?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.68,0:19:29.06,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,Without an observer,\N everyone would have ended up as mere probabilities.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.90,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,They have to understand
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.90,0:19:36.82,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,that no matter where we wind up,\N we have to keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.70,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,No one can accuse Nagara of anything—
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.78,Default,Koumori,0,0,0,,nor will I allow them to.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.91,0:19:48.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The others have already left.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.41,0:19:49.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.54,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,And they aren't coming back?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.54,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, they don't plan to.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.71,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, here.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.18,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.72,0:20:07.18,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Do you also believe that we're never going home?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.47,0:20:10.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Has the light gone out?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.40,0:20:14.61,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.70,0:20:24.49,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I've decided to go on a voyage in this.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.62,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Once I've seen all the other worlds,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.62,0:20:28.95,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'm going to crack the truth about this universe.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.45,0:20:33.21,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I don't know how far I'm going to get,\N but I'm going to do as much as I can.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:33.92,0:20:37.21,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Rajdhani, there's nothing you can't do,\N and no place you can't go.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.84,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I guarantee you that!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.47,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, so uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.26,0:20:47.93,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You know that statue of Buddha you treasured so much?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Gen broke it, and I secretly replaced it with a new one.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.39,0:20:56.06,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wanted to at least apologize for that.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.06,0:20:57.36,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Just once?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.27,0:21:01.07,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That's okay. I forgive you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.03,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Nagara...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.86,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,There's something I wanted to give you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.45,0:21:07.37,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.66,0:21:12.54,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This is Monkey Hairball, the power relic you got for beating that world.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.87,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I've spent a long time trying to understand its effects,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and I finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.83,0:21:18.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.17,0:21:19.29,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Give it a sniff.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.72,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Smells good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.72,0:21:26.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it smells like sunshine.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.55,0:21:29.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that all?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.01,0:21:29.76,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.22,0:21:34.52,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But that scent will never go away,\N and it will never change.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.52,0:21:37.40,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Even if you set it on fire, or boil it in curry.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.06,0:21:41.19,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No matter where it is,\N or what condition it's in, it never changes.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.19,0:21:43.44,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It's the perfect power for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.78,0:21:46.78,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.49,0:21:51.70,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'm glad we became friends.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.08,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.21,0:22:00.67,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Right back at you!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.85,0:22:15.43,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,How long are you guys planning to stay on this island?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.02,0:22:17.81,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You should come with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.81,0:22:22.44,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Nozomi, you can't do anything,\N so you'd be safer with me, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:23.11,0:22:25.19,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Nagara, you'd come too, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.82,0:22:28.82,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I won't. There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.99,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:35.91,0:22:36.95,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.50,0:22:39.87,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Don't you understand the situation?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.87,0:22:42.71,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,We can never go home again.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.50,0:22:46.76,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm going to continue down my path.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.76,0:22:48.22,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.30,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like that. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.18,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey Nozomi, you're in too, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.01,0:22:56.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:58.98,0:23:00.94,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,not sure what I'm going to do...
